      "comment": "Judge error. I searched the guide: there is no \"SYNTH\" or \"synthetic\" reference at all, so that part of the rationale is invented. Everything else the judge calls accurate, and I confirmed the volume IDs, indexing percentages and 1811 formation against tool output. No defect identified."
