      "llm_score": 2,
      "corrected_score": 2,
      "comment": "The judge says the Ballylinny example is not connected to the gap, but line 59 of the guide does connect it. The real failure: the tool result says the registers were \"indexed by the Ulster Historical Foundation\", yet the guide lists the Foundation only for graveyard and emigration databases and never ties it to the pre-1864 church-register gap — the second failure under test."
